&lt;p style="margin-left: 30px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt;(1) 受取手形、売掛金及び契約資産&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 144px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-right: 12px; text-align: right"&gt;84,153&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 144px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-right: 12px; text-align: right"&gt;83,395&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 144px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-right: 12px; text-align: right"&gt;△757&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 26.33px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 216px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 30px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt;(2) 投資有価証券&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
